Noto Emoji
==========

The emoji PNGs in this directory are from the Noto Emoji project:
https://github.com/googlefonts/noto-emoji (png/128/).

Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.
https://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0

Bundled files map to shared::dbus::REACTION_IDS:

  emoji_u1f44d.png  U+1F44D  👍  thumbs_up
  emoji_u1f44e.png  U+1F44E  👎  thumbs_down
  emoji_u2764.png   U+2764   ❤   heart
  emoji_u1f602.png  U+1F602  😂  joy
  emoji_u1f389.png  U+1F389  🎉  tada
  emoji_u1f44f.png  U+1F44F  👏  clap
